{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/e51ffd084e90f7a898d19760237b2fba.avif?t=1773072029\" width=450 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/54a5977d4c0b7ebdc164f3f4ccfcdc5a.poster.avif?t=1773072029\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/54a5977d4c0b7ebdc164f3f4ccfcdc5a.webm?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/54a5977d4c0b7ebdc164f3f4ccfcdc5a.mp4?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The kingdom is threatened by the <strong>mysterious Fungomancer.</strong> Unite the clans and face off against this common enemy. Choose unique insect with their specific abilities, focus on their synergies and place them strategically to overcome the dangers that come your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/2223f122688da732a979e3aedfe3bd83.avif?t=1773072029\" width=450 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/9780806d9498f0963ae0885ccc738b44.poster.avif?t=1773072029\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/9780806d9498f0963ae0885ccc738b44.webm?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/9780806d9498f0963ae0885ccc738b44.mp4?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Hive Blight, you\u2019ll start by choosing an alliance between two clans, shaping your available units, equipment, trinkets, and synergies. Each clan has its own playstyle: the Vespadas excel in offense and debuffs, the Silent Cabbale use poison and ambush tactics, and the Sweet Symphoney rely on healing and seduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/de70165b67981c84959379d1047c111d.avif?t=1773072029\" width=600 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Combine the clan cleverly, like pairing the Cabbale\u2019s ambush with the Vespadas\u2019 brute force, and you might discover combos even we didn\u2019t predict.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/2bc3f223119260f434f48b393f7498dd.avif?t=1773072029\" width=450 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/861667c01536673c572c83abfab73efd.poster.avif?t=1773072029\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/861667c01536673c572c83abfab73efd.webm?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/861667c01536673c572c83abfab73efd.mp4?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each clan comes with a panel of <strong>unique units with each their specific abilities and stats</strong>, it\u2019s up to you to make a choice depending on your playstyle and what you get during your run. Focus on the synergies between their abilities to get the best out of each of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/863ff45462643eca07f88943c142f149.avif?t=1773072029\" width=720 height=712 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Discover more than 30 unique characters</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/54bc5520e94aff0fcd3fd66a25b608f2.avif?t=1773072029\" width=450 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/bd0365887ab62bbd0a11e80e363cd020.poster.avif?t=1773072029\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/bd0365887ab62bbd0a11e80e363cd020.webm?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/bd0365887ab62bbd0a11e80e363cd020.mp4?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The world is full of surprises!</strong> Explore its lush environment to find ways to improve your troops! Find or <strong>buy equipment</strong>, discover <strong>sacred altars</strong> with long lost powers, drink <strong>mysterious potions</strong> to boost your unit or visit the <strong>forge</strong>! There are many ways for you to get stronger, make wise decisions on the road to get there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/2d65f2f7573c0481b2bebab93719317c.avif?t=1773072029\" width=750 height=752 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Discover more than 40 unique equipments and trinkets\u00a0</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/8857c11fddd4e7188217b62265703dd5.avif?t=1773072029\" width=450 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/445a6b4fa1e2998a799c7ccdd1cf7d78.poster.avif?t=1773072029\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/445a6b4fa1e2998a799c7ccdd1cf7d78.webm?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">