 Cabbale use poison and ambush tactics, and the Sweet Symphoney rely on healing and seduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/de70165b67981c84959379d1047c111d.avif?t=1773072029\" width=600 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Combine the clan cleverly, like pairing the Cabbale\u2019s ambush with the Vespadas\u2019 brute force, and you might discover combos even we didn\u2019t predict.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/2bc3f223119260f434f48b393f7498dd.avif?t=1773072029\" width=450 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/861667c01536673c572c83abfab73efd.poster.avif?t=1773072029\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/861667c01536673c572c83abfab73efd.webm?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/861667c01536673c572c83abfab73efd.mp4?t=1773072029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each clan comes with a panel of <strong>unique units with each their specific abilities and stats</strong>, it\u2019s up to you to make a choice depending on your playstyle and what you get during your run. Focus on the synergies between their abilities to get